{ "Disables HUDFix resource tracking and\nreduces CPU overhead.\nUseful for MLFG which deals well with the HUD.\n\nAfter changing, please Save Settings and restart.", "Desativa o rastreamento de recursos do HUDFix e\nreduz o custo de CPU.\nÚtil com MLFG, que lida bem com o HUD.\n\nDepois de mudar, salve as configurações e reinicie." },
